BEGIN_DESC
TANTRA BETA 9 - Moon, jet pack at Brighton Beach.
Moon, Brighton Beach base: Niza Krit in the suit, the jet pack lying two metres in front of her
(12 kg metallic hydrogen, 2 x 500 N, ~950 m/s). Walk up to it (W) and press B to put it on; B again takes it off.
ON FOOT: W/S walk (S brakes), A/D turn, Q/E side step, Shift run, Space jump. F1 eyes / outside view. Right mouse held (eyes view):
look around. H suit computer, L lamps, Shift+V sun shade.
JET PACK: starts in MANUAL (no compensation). Space thrust up, left Ctrl down; Shift+Space full thrust, Shift+Ctrl thrust off
(while held). Numpad 0 / . throttle. In the air: W/S pod vector (forward / brake), A/D turn, Q/E strafe, Shift full vector.
J height hold, C landing autopilot, G booms, Caps Lock steering limiter.
SUIT COMPUTER (eyes view, mouse): toggle ASSIST (top right) for safe thrust, upright hold and ground braking; buttons at the bottom
of the right page: HEIGHT HOLD, TRANSFER (pick a target on TARGETS - fly to another base within 15 km and land on a pad),
LANDING, STOP (kill all speeds, hold height). FLIGHT page: cruise height and speed. Screens are in Russian in this beta.
Known: footsteps are heard in vacuum.
END_DESC

